<speech id="uk.org.publicwhip/westminhall/2016-04-18a.224.0" person_id="uk.org.publicwhip/person/25280" speakername="Gavin Robinson" colnum="224" time="17:13:00" url="">
    <p pid="a224.0/1">Our colleague <phrase class="honfriend" person_id="uk.org.publicwhip/person/13856" name="Margaret Ritchie">the hon. Member for South Down (Ms Ritchie)</phrase> could not be with us today, but she lost her sister, who was completely asymptomatic, at the age of 37. That reinforces the point that discovery often occurs too late, which is why research and awareness are crucial.</p>
</speech>
